ion\" content=\"Explore the history of LY Corporation.\">\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.lycorp.co.jp/en/company/history/lycorp/\">\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"LY Corporation\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://www.lycorp.co.jp/assets/images/ogp_ly_en_bk_1200_628.png\">\n<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\">\n<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\">\n<meta property=\"og:published_time\" content=\"2026-06-16T14:09:38+09:00\">\n<meta property=\"og:modified_time\" content=\"2026-07-02T09:23:52+09:00\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n</head>\n\n\n<body>\n<!-- Google Tag Manager (noscript) -->\n<noscript><iframe src=\"https://www.googletagmanager.com/ns.html?id=GTM-NJPSPSD5\"\n    height=\"0\" width=\"0\" style=\"display:none;visibility:hidden\"></iframe></noscript>\n<!-- End Google Tag Manager (noscript) -->\n\n\n<script src=\"/en/en_header2.js\"></script>\n\n\n<div class=\"global-container\">\n\n\n<nav class=\"breadcrumbs\">\n        <ul>\n                <li><a href=\"/en/\"><img src=\"/assets/images/icon_home.svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" alt=\"Home\"></a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"https://www.lycorp.co.jp/en/company/\">Corporate Information</a></li>\n                <li>History - LY Corporation</li>\n        </ul>\n</nav>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"page-heading-lv3\">\n\t<div class=\"inner\">\n\t\t<h1>History - LY Corporation</h1>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"body-container\">\n\t<div class=\"body-inner search-target\">\n\n\n\t\t<div class=\"c-left-nav-container\">\n\t\t<dl class=\"sp-nav\">\n\t\t<dt>History of each company</dt>\n\t\t<dd>\n\t\t<ul>\n\t\t<li><a href=\"/en/company/history/lycorp/\">LY Corporation</a></li>\n\t\t<li><a href=\"/en/company/history/yahoo/\">Yahoo Japan Corporation</a></li>\n\t\t<li><a href=\"/en/company/history/line/\">LINE Corporation</a></li>\n\t\t<li><a href=\"/en/company/history/z-holdings/\">Z Holdings Corporation</a></li>\n\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</dd>\n\t\t</dl>\n\t\t<div class=\"nav-col\">\n\t\t<ul>\n\t\t<li><a href=\"/en/company/history/lycorp/\">LY Corporation</a></li>\n\t\t<li><a href=\"/en/company/history/yahoo/\">Yahoo Japan Corporation</a></li>\n\t\t<li><a href=\"/en/company/history/line/\">LINE Corporation</a></li>\n\t\t<li><a href=\"/en/company/history/z-holdings/\">Z Holdings Corporation</a></li>\n\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</div><!-- /.nav-col -->\n\t\t<div class=\"body-col p-history\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"history-heading\">2023</h2>\n\t\t<ul class=\"history-list\">\n\t\t<li>\n\t\t<div class=\"txt\">\n\t\t<div class=\"date\">October 2023</div>\n\t\t<h3 class=\"heading\">Foundation of LY Corporation</h3>\n\t\t<ul class=\"c-tag-list\">\n\t\t<li><span>Japan</span></li>\n\t\t<li><span>Company</span></li>\n\t\t</ul>\n\t\t<p class=\"c-body\">LY Corporation was established following an internal reorganization involving Z Holdings Corporation, LINE Corporation, and Yahoo Japan Corporation, upholding the mission of \"Create an amazing life platform that brings WOW! to our users.\"</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"img\"><img src=\"/en/company/history/lycorp/history_lycorp001_en.png\" alt=\"\"></div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li>\n\t\t<div class=\"txt\">\n\t\t<div class=\"date\">October 2023</div>\n\t\t<h3 class=\"heading\">Rabbit LINE Pay Company Limited changed its trade name to LINE Pay (Thailand) Company Limited</h3>\n\t\t<ul class=\"c-tag-list\">\n\t\t<li><span>Global</span></li>\n\t\t<li><span>Company</span></li>\n\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li>\n\t\t<div class=\"txt\">\n\t\t<div class=\"date\">November 2023</div>\n\t\t<h3 class=\"heading\">Launched \"LYP Premium\"</h3>\n\t\t<ul class=\"c-tag-list\">\n\t\t<li><span>Japan</span></li>\n\t\t<li><span>Service</span></li>\n\t\t</ul>\n\t\t<p class=\"c-body\">Previously known as Yahoo! JAPAN Premium, the service was renamed and includes LINE benefits such as unlimited use of over 12 million eligible LINE stickers, along with the existing Yahoo! JAPAN perks.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"img\"><img src=\"https://www.lycorp.co.jp/en/company/history/lycorp/history_lycorp002_en.png\" alt=\"\"></div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t</ul>\n\t\t<h2 class=\"history-heading\">2024</h2>\n\t\t<ul class=\"history-list\">\n\t\t<li>\n\t\t<div class=\"txt\">\n\t\t<div class=\"date\">December 2024</div>\n\t\t<h3 class=\"heading\">LINE Pay Taiwan Limited was listed on the Taiwan Stock Exchange (TWSE).</h3>\n\t\t<ul class=\"c-tag-list\">\n\t\t<li><span>Global</span></li>\n\t\t<li><span>Company</span></li>\n\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"img\"><img src=\"/ja/company/history/lycorp/history_lycorp003.png\" alt=\"\"></div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t</ul>\n\t\t<h2 class=\"history-heading\">2025</h2>\n\t\t<ul class=\"history-list\">\n\t\t<li>\n\t\t<div class=\"txt\">\n\t\t<div class=\"date\">April 2025</div>\n\t\t<h3 class=\"heading\">Generative AI enhanced the Yahoo! JAPAN app and LINE</h3>\n\t\t<ul class=\"c-tag-list\">\n\t\t<li><span>Japan</span></li>\n\t\t<li><span>Service</span></li>\n\t\t</ul>\n\t\t<p class=\"c-body\">The Yahoo! JAPAN app and LINE were enhanced through the introduction of generative AI. An \"AI Assistant\" feature was launched in the Yahoo! JAPAN app, allowing users to explore information in greater depth through natural conversations. LINE introduced \"LINE AI,\" a feature that enables users to ask questions and generate images, along with \"LINE AI Talk Suggestions,\" which assists users in drafting replies. Both services became more convenient by making generative AI more accessible to users.<br>Note: In April 2026, these features were integrated into \"Agent i.\"</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"img\"><img src=\"/ja/company/history/lycorp/history_lycorp005.png\" alt=\"\"></div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li>\n\t\t<div class=\"txt\">\n\t\t<div class=\"date\">December 2025</div>\n\t\t<h3 class=\"heading\">LINE reached 100 million monthly users in Japan</h3>\n\t\t<ul class=\"c-tag-list\">\n\t\t<li><span>Japan</span></li>\n\t\t<li><span>Service</span></li>\n\t\t</ul>\n\t\t<p class=\"c-body\">LINE’s monthly users in Japan surpassed 100 million. To commemorate the milestone, a special website was launched highlighting LINE's journey to date and behind-the-scenes stories from its early days.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"img\"><img src=\"/ja/company/history/lycorp/history_lycorp004.png\" alt=\"\"></div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t</ul>\n\t\t<h2 class=\"history-heading\">2026</h2>\n\t\t<ul class=\"history-list\">\n\t\t<li>\n\t\t<div class=\"txt\">\n\t\t<div class=\"date\">March 2026</div>\n\t\t<h3 class=\"heading\">PayPay listed on the NASDAQ market</h3>\n\t\t<ul class=\"c-tag-list\">\n\t\t<li><span>Global</span></li>\n\t\t<li><span>Company</span></li>\n\t\t</ul>\n\t\t<p class=\"c-body\">PayPay Corporation, a consolidated subsidiary of the company, newly listed its American Depositary Shares (ADS) on the NASDAQ market in the United States.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t</ul>\n\t\t<p class=\"c-note mt60 sp-mt80 right\">As of March 31, 2026</p>\n\t\t</div><!-- /.body-col.p-history -->\n\t\t</div><!-- /.c-left-nav-container -->\n\n\n\t</div><!-- /.body-inner -->\n</div><!-- /.body-container -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<script src=\"/en/en_footer.js\"></script>\n\n\n</div><!-- /.global-container -->\n\n<a href=\"#top\" class=\"page-top\">Page top</a>\n\n\n<script src=\"/assets/js/lib.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"/assets/js/common.js\"></script>\n\n\n\n</body>\n\n</html>\n\n[END UNTRUSTED WEB CONTENT] boundary=fafc1493d854727f\n"
